      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "All up we got 6 quotes. The two companies who gave us straight forward advice and information were Living power and Nicholls Solar.Both used and recommended similar top quality panels and the same inverters. Although Living power were not the cheapest, they had a three week lead time for installation. They arrived on the nominated day, a Monday, which was the same day we got the \"Permission To Connect\"Installed the system that day and connected to the grid on the Friday. They handled all the paper work and did what they said, when they said they would do it. Some of the other companies were only interested in selling us a system at a cheap price that would not satisify our needs.",
