      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Living Power was not the cheapest quote in fact the total cost was $600.00 above. One of the companies which advertises very heavily within the building industry drove me mad constantly lowering their price in an endeavour to clear the warehouse as they claimed. The cheapest quote, from a company which was on your list and operating interstate, could not carry out the work till July some time.I gave them the job for a number reasons,  the quality of the equipment, they are local and there was no baloney. Their boss is also a nice guy and accommodating, nothing was too much trouble.The system was installed within 6-7hours of their arriving on the job  and it is now operating most efficiently. I am extremely happy with the end result and have no hesitation in recommending Living Power to any one wanting to go Solar.",
